\title{5. State of the gates on 2026-11-24 (regenerate with the commands of section 1)}

\p{Last regeneration: main tree as published 10:46-10:55Z, \code{\verb~|Op.HOST_DEPTH = 128~} (every report names the publication it measured). Earlier states are in \code{\verb~|work/status/machine-M8.log~}.}

\table{
\tr{\th{Gate / acceptance item}\th{Result}\th{Report}}
